      "text": "[10:04PM] #Ijanikin #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement from Abule Ado to Iyana Iba is good.\nThe intersection is slightly busy due to commercial activities.\nTraffic flow is smooth from Iyana Iba to Igando and back.\nMovement in and out of Igbo Elerin is smooth. \nAfolabi Ege Flyover link to LASU-Isheri road is clear. \nBadagry Expressway is moving well from Iyana Iba to Agbara with no major impediments reported.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
